PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY

AI/LLM Evaluation professional with hands-on experience evaluating LLM-powered, multimodal, conversational, and AI-agent workflows in production environments. Experienced in assessing AI responses for task completion, factuality, instruction following, reasoning quality, relevance, safety, hallucinations, and overall response quality using structured evaluation rubrics.

Hands-on experience with A/B preference ranking, Likert/ELO-style evaluation, PRP/IRP-based assessment, multimodal annotation, grounding, GUI-agent evaluation, live speech-to-speech evaluation, transcription quality review, and evidence-based error identification.

Experienced in identifying subtle model failures, documenting evaluation evidence, maintaining rating consistency, and escalating ambiguous cases. Familiar with evaluating AI systems across text, image, video, audio, conversational, and agentic/GUI interaction scenarios.

