INNODATA

AI/LLM Evaluation Analyst / AI Data & Quality Specialist
June 2026 – August 2026 | Remote

* Evaluated LLM-generated responses against structured quality criteria including factuality, instruction following, reasoning, relevance, fluency, safety, and hallucination risk.
